content.text:
---
path: src/core/ownership.ts
![high](https://www.gstatic.com/codereviewagent/high-priority.svg)

The `deepFreeze` function does not perform cycle detection. If it is called on a cyclic object structure, it will result in infinite recursion and a stack overflow (`RangeError: Maximum call stack size exceeded`).

